<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CsConverter.alpha> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Firing angle that determines the dc voltage at the converter dc terminal. Typical value between 10 degrees and 18 degrees for a rectifier. It is converters state variable result from power flow. The attribute shall be a positive value." .
