<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PanDemandResponse.heatingSetpoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PanDemandResponse> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PanDemandResponse.heatingSetpoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Temperature> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PanDemandResponse.heatingSetpoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Requested heating set point. Temperature set point is typically defined and calculated based on local temperature." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PanDemandResponse.heatingSetpoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heatingSetpoint"@en .
