<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.aggregate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AggregateKind> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.aggregate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Salient attribute of the reading data aggregated from individual endpoints. This is mainly used to define a mathematical operation carried out over macroPeriod but may also be used to describe an attribute of the data when the macroPeriod is not defined." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.aggregate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "aggregate"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.argument
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.argument> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
