<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.argument> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Argument used to introduce numbers into the unit of measure description where they are needed e.g. 4 where the measure needs an argument such as CEMIn4. Most arguments used in practice however will be integers i.e. denominator1.Value 0 in numerator and denominator means not applicable." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.argument> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "argument"@en .
# 
