<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.flowDirection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Flow direction for a reading where the direction of flow of the commodity is important for electricity measurements this includes current energy power and demand." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.flowDirection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "flowDirection"@en .
