<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.interharmonic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.interharmonic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingInterharmonic> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.interharmonic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indication of a harmonic or interharmonic basis for the measurement. Value 0 in numerator and denominator means not applicable." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.interharmonic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "interharmonic"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.macroPeriod
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.macroPeriod> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
