# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CoordinateSystem.crsUrn
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CoordinateSystem.crsUrn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CoordinateSystem.crsUrn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CoordinateSystem> .
