<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Quality61850.failure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Quality61850.failure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This identifier indicates that a supervision function has detected an internal or external failure e.g. communication failure." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Quality61850.failure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "failure"@en .
