# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Quality61850.operatorBlocked
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Quality61850.operatorBlocked> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Quality61850.operatorBlocked> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Quality61850> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Quality61850.operatorBlocked> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Quality61850.operatorBlocked> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Measurement value is blocked and hence unavailable for transmission. " .
