<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Quality61850.suspect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Quality61850> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Quality61850.suspect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Quality61850.suspect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A correlation function has detected that the value is not consistent with other values. Typically set by a network State Estimator." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Quality61850.suspect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "suspect"@en .
