<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#RUCAwardInstruction.RUCAward> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The RUC Award of a resource is the portion of the RUC Capacity that is not under RA or RMR contracts. The RUC Award of a resource is the portion of the RUC Capacity that is eligible for RUC Availability payment." .
