<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#RUCAwardInstruction.RUCCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#RUCAwardInstruction> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#RUCAwardInstruction.RUCCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#float> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#RUCAwardInstruction.RUCCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The RUC Capacity of a resource is the difference between i the RUC Schedule and ii the higher of the DA Schedule and the Minimum Load." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#RUCAwardInstruction.RUCCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RUCCapacity"@en .
