<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingInterharmonic.denominator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Interharmonic denominator. Value 0 means not applicable. Value 2 is used in combination with numerator1 to represent interharmonic 12. Finally value 1 indicates the harmonic of the order specified with numerator." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingInterharmonic.denominator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "denominator"@en .
