<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.cpp> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.cpp> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.cpp> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Critical peak period CPP bucket the reading value is attributed to. Value 0 means not applicable. Even though CPP is usually considered a specialised form of time of use tou this attribute is defined explicitly for flexibility." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType.cpp> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "cpp"@en .
