<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#RegulatingControl.targetValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#RegulatingControl> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#RegulatingControl.targetValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#float> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#RegulatingControl.targetValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The target value specified for case input.   This value can be used for the target value without the use of schedules. The value has the units appropriate to the mode attribute." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#RegulatingControl.targetValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "targetValue"@en .
