<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchingStep.subStepSequenceNumber> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchingStep.subStepSequenceNumber> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Supports compound switching steps that are made up of several sub steps." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchingStep.subStepSequenceNumber> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "subStepSequenceNumber"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchingStepGroup.isFreeSequence
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchingStepGroup.isFreeSequence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchingStepGroup.isFreeSequence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchingStepGroup> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchingStepGroup.isFreeSequence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchingStepGroup.isFreeSequence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "If true the sequence number serves for presentation purposes only and the activity itself may be executed at any time." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SwitchingStepGroup.isFreeSequence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "isFreeSequence"@en .
