<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AssetInfo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AssetInfo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#IdentifiedObject> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AssetInfo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Set of attributes of an asset representing typical datasheet information of a physical device that can be instantiated and shared in different data exchange contexts as attributes of an asset instance installed or in stock as attributes of an asset model product by a manufacturer as attributes of a type asset generic type of an asset as used in designsextension planning." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AssetInfo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AssetInfo"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AssetKind
