<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AuxiliaryCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Models Market clearing results for Auxiliary costs." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AuxiliaryCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AuxiliaryCost"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AuxiliaryEquipment
