<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AuxiliaryEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "AuxiliaryEquipment describe equipment that is not performing any primary functions but support for the equipment performing the primary function.AuxiliaryEquipment is attached to primary equipment via an association with Terminal." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AuxiliaryEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AuxiliaryEquipment"@en .
