<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#BaseCaseConstraintLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Possibly timevarying max MW or MVA and optionally Min MW limit or MVA limit Y1 and Y2 respectively assigned to a contingency analysis base case. Use CurveSchedule XAxisUnits to specify MW or MVA. To be used only if the BaseCaseConstraintLimit differs from the DefaultConstraintLimit." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#BaseCaseConstraintLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "BaseCaseConstraintLimit"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#BaseFrequency
