<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#BaseFrequency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The BaseFrequency class describes a base frequency for a power system network. In case of multiple power networks with different frequencies e.g. 50 Hz or 60 Hz each network will have its own base frequency class. Hence it is assumed that power system objects having different base frequencies appear in separate documents where each document has a single base frequency instance." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#BaseFrequency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "BaseFrequency"@en .
