<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ConditionFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#WorkIdentifiedObject> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ConditionFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This is to specify the various condition factors for a design that may alter the cost estimate or the allocation." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ConditionFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ConditionFactor"@en .
