<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ConnectivityNode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Connectivity nodes are points where terminals of AC conducting equipment are connected together with zero impedance." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ConnectivityNode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ConnectivityNode"@en .
