<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ConnectivityNodeContainer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A base class for all objects that may contain connectivity nodes or topological nodes." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ConnectivityNodeContainer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ConnectivityNodeContainer"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Connector
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Connector> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
