<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Contingency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#IdentifiedObject> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Contingency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An event threatening system reliability consisting of one or more contingency elements." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Contingency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Contingency"@en .
# 
