<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContingencyConstraintLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Possibly timevarying max MW or MVA and optionally Min MW limit or MVA limit Y1 and Y2 respectively assigned to a constraint for a specific contingency. Use CurveSchedule XAxisUnits to specify MW or MVA." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContingencyConstraintLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ContingencyConstraintLimit"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContingencyElement
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContingencyElement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
