<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContingencyElement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An element of a system event to be studied by contingency analysis representing a change in status of a single piece of equipment. " .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContingencyElement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ContingencyElement"@en .
# 
