<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContingencyEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContingencyElement> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContingencyEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Equipment whose in service status is to change such as a power transformer or AC line segment." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContingencyEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ContingencyEquipment"@en .
