<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContingencyEquipmentStatusKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates the state which the contingency equipment is to be in when the contingency is applied." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContingencyEquipmentStatusKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ContingencyEquipmentStatusKind"@en .
