<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContractRight> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ContractRight"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContractType
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ContractType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
