<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ControlAreaSolutionData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "State Estimator Solution Pool Interchange and Losses." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ControlAreaSolutionData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ControlAreaSolutionData"@en .
