<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ControlAreaTypeKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Enumeration> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ControlAreaTypeKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The type of control area." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ControlAreaTypeKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ControlAreaTypeKind"@en .
