# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CrossCompoundTurbineGovernorDynamics
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CrossCompoundTurbineGovernorDynamics> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CrossCompoundTurbineGovernorDynamics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DynamicsFunctionBlock> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CrossCompoundTurbineGovernorDynamics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Turbinegovernor crosscompound function block whose behaviour is described by reference to a standard model font color0f0f0for by definition of a userdefined model.font" .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CrossCompoundTurbineGovernorDynamics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CrossCompoundTurbineGovernorDynamics"@en .
