<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CustomerBillingKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Enumeration> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CustomerBillingKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Kind of customer billing." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CustomerBillingKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CustomerBillingKind"@en .
# 
