<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DefaultBidCurve> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Curve> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DefaultBidCurve> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Default bid curve for default energy bid curve and default startup curves cost and time." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DefaultBidCurve> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DefaultBidCurve"@en .
# 
