<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DefaultBidCurveData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CurveData> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DefaultBidCurveData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Curve data for default bid curve and startup cost curve." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DefaultBidCurveData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DefaultBidCurveData"@en .
