<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DifferentialModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Toplevel> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DifferentialModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A set of statements describing the changes in the network model. The statement is defined in the incremental model. " .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DifferentialModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DifferentialModel"@en .
