<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DimensionsInfo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "As applicable the basic linear area or volume dimensions of an asset asset type AssetModel or other type of object such as land area. Units and multipliers are specified per dimension." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DimensionsInfo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DimensionsInfo"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiscExcContIEEEDEC1A
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiscExcContIEEEDEC1A> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiscExcContIEEEDEC1A> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiscontinuousExcitationControlDynamics> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiscExcContIEEEDEC1A> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "IEEE type DEC1A discontinuous excitation control model that boosts generator excitation to a level higher than that demanded by the voltage regulator and stabilizer immediately following a system fault.Reference IEEE 421.52005 12.2. " .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiscExcContIEEEDEC1A> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DiscExcContIEEEDEC1A"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiscExcContIEEEDEC2A
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiscExcContIEEEDEC2A> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiscExcContIEEEDEC2A> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiscontinuousExcitationControlDynamics> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiscExcContIEEEDEC2A> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "IEEE type DEC2A model for discontinuous excitation control. This system provides transient excitation boosting via an openloop control as initiated by a trigger signal generated remotely.Reference IEEE 421.52005 12.3. " .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiscExcContIEEEDEC2A> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DiscExcContIEEEDEC2A"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiscExcContIEEEDEC3A
