<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Duration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Duration as PnYnMnDTnHnMnS which conforms to ISO 8601 where nY expresses a number of years nM a number of months nD a number of days. The letter T separates the date expression from the time expression and after it nH identifies a number of hours nM a number of minutes and nS a number of seconds. The number of seconds could be expressed as a decimal number but all other numbers are integers." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Duration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Duration"@en .
