<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#EmissionAccount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Curve> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#EmissionAccount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Accounts for tracking emissions usage and credits for thermal generating units. A unit may have zero or more emission accounts and will typically have one for tracking usage and one for tracking credits." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#EmissionAccount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EmissionAccount"@en .
