<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#EmissionCurve> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relationship between the units emission rate in units of mass per hour Yaxis and output active power Xaxis for a given type of emission. This curve applies when only one type of fuel is being burned." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#EmissionCurve> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EmissionCurve"@en .
