<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcAVR3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Italian excitation system. It represents an exciter dynamo and electric regulator. " .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcAVR3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ExcAVR3"@en .
