<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcAVR7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcitationSystemDynamics> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcAVR7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "IVO excitation system." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcAVR7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ExcAVR7"@en .
# 
