<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcBBC> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcBBC> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcitationSystemDynamics> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcBBC> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Transformer fed static excitation system static with ABB regulator. This model represents a static excitation system in which a gated thyristor bridge fed by a transformer at the main generator terminals feeds the main generator directly." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcBBC> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ExcBBC"@en .
