<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcDC1A> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcDC1A> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcitationSystemDynamics> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcDC1A> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Modified IEEE DC1A direct current commutator exciter with speed input and without underexcitation limiters UEL inputs." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcDC1A> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ExcDC1A"@en .
