<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#LoadGenericNonLinear> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Generic nonlinear dynamic GNLD load. This model can be used in midterm and longterm voltage stability simulations i.e. to study voltage collapse as it can replace a more detailed representation of aggregate load including induction motors thermostatically controlled and static loads." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#LoadGenericNonLinear> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LoadGenericNonLinear"@en .
