<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#LocalReliabilityArea> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Allows definition of reliability areas e.g.. load pockets within the ISORTO." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#LocalReliabilityArea> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LocalReliabilityArea"@en .
