<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Location> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Location> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#IdentifiedObject> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Location> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The place scene or point of something where someone or something has been is andor will be at a given moment in time. It can be defined with one or more position points coordinates in a given coordinate system." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Location> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Location"@en .
