<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MarketRegionResults> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Provides all Region Ancillary Service results for the DA and RT markets. The specific data is commodity type Regulation Up Regulation Down Spinning Reserve Nonspinning Reserve or Total Up reserves based for the cleared MW cleared price and total capacity required for the region." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MarketRegionResults> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MarketRegionResults"@en .
