<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MarketResults> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This class holds elements that are single values for the entire market time horizon. That is for the Day Ahead market there is 1 value for each element not hourly based.  Is a summary of the market run." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MarketResults> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MarketResults"@en .
