<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MeasurementCalculator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#IdentifiedObject> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MeasurementCalculator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Result of a calculation of one or more measurement. " .
