<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MeasurementValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The current state for a measurement. A state value is an instance of a measurement from a specific source. Measurements can be associated with many state values each representing a different source for the measurement." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MeasurementValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MeasurementValue"@en .
