<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ModelToBeDeleted> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Model is a collection of Datasets." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ModelToBeDeleted> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ModelToBeDeleted"@en .
