<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#NonConformLoadSchedule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SeasonDayTypeSchedule> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#NonConformLoadSchedule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An active power Y1axis and reactive power Y2axis schedule curves versus time Xaxis for nonconforming loads e.g. large industrial load or power station service where modelled." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#NonConformLoadSchedule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "NonConformLoadSchedule"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#NonStandardItem
