<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#OutageArea> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Toplevel> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#OutageArea> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This defines the area covered by the Outage." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#OutageArea> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OutageArea"@en .
