<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#OverexcLimX1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#OverexcitationLimiterDynamics> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#OverexcLimX1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Field voltage over excitation limiter." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#OverexcLimX1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OverexcLimX1"@en .
