<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#OverexcLimX2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Field voltage or current overexcitation limiter designed to protect the generator field of an AC machine with automatic excitation control from overheating due to prolonged overexcitation." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#OverexcLimX2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OverexcLimX2"@en .
