<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PowerSystemStabilizerDynamics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Power system stabilizer function block whose behaviour is described by reference to a standard model font color0f0f0for by definition of a userdefined model.font" .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PowerSystemStabilizerDynamics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PowerSystemStabilizerDynamics"@en .
