<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingQualityType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Detailed description for a quality of a reading value produced by an end device or a system. Values in attributes allow for creation of the recommended codes to be used for identifying reading value quality codes as follows systemId.category.subCategory." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingQualityType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReadingQualityType"@en .
