<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingReasonKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Reason for the reading being taken." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingReasonKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReadingReasonKind"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType
