<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#RegisteredGenerator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Model of a generator  that is registered to participate in the market." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#RegisteredGenerator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RegisteredGenerator"@en .
