<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReserveDemandCurve> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Reserve demand curve.  Models maximum quantities of reserve required per Market Region and models a reserve demand curve for the minimum quantities of reserve. The ReserveDemandCurve is a relationship between unit operating reserve price in MWhr Yaxis and unit reserves in MW Xaxis." .
