<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReserveReq> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Requirements for minimum amount of reserve andor regulation to be supplied by a set of qualified resources." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReserveReq> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReserveReq"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReserveReqCurve
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReserveReqCurve> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
