<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReserveReqCurve> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A curve relating  reserve requirement versus time showing the values of a specific reserve requirement for each unit of the period covered. The  curve can be based on absolute time or on normalized time. X is time typically expressed in absolute timeY1 is reserve requirement typically expressed in MW" .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReserveReqCurve> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReserveReqCurve"@en .
