<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SecurityConstraints> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#IdentifiedObject> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SecurityConstraints> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Typical for regional transmission operators RTOs these constraints include transmission as well as generation group constraints identified in both base case and critical contingency cases." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#SecurityConstraints> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SecurityConstraints"@en .
