<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ServicePoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#IdentifiedObject> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ServicePoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The defined termination points of a transmission path. Service points are defined from the viewpoint of the transmission service. Each service point is contained within or on the boundary of an interchange area. A service point is source or destination of a transaction." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ServicePoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ServicePoint"@en .
