<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ShiftPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The patterns of shifts worked by people or crews." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ShiftPattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ShiftPattern"@en .
