# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#StaticVarCompensator
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#StaticVarCompensator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
