<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#StaticVarCompensatorDynamics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Static var compensator whose behaviour is described by reference to a standard model font color0f0f0for by definition of a userdefined model.font" .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#StaticVarCompensatorDynamics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "StaticVarCompensatorDynamics"@en .
