<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Tender> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Tender is what is offered by the customer towards making a payment and is often more than the required payment hence the need for change. The payment is thus that part of the Tender that goes towards settlement of a particular transaction.Tender is modelled as an aggregation of Cheque and Card. Both these tender types can exist in a single tender bid thus accountHolderName has to exist separately in each of Cheque and Card as each could have a different account holder name." .
