# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransformerMeshImpedance
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransformerMeshImpedance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransformerMeshImpedance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#IdentifiedObject> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransformerMeshImpedance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Transformer mesh impedance Deltamodel between transformer ends.The typical case is that this class describes the impedance between two transformer ends pairwise i.e. the cardinalities at both transformer end associations are 1. However in cases where two or more transformer ends are modelled the cardinalities are larger than 1." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransformerMeshImpedance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TransformerMeshImpedance"@en .
