<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransformerObservation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#IdentifiedObject> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransformerObservation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Common information captured during transformer inspections andor diagnostics. Note that some properties may be measured through other means and therefore have measurement values in addition to the observed values recorded here." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransformerObservation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TransformerObservation"@en .
