<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#UsagePoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Logical or physical point in the network to which readings or events may be attributed. Used at the place where a physical or virtual meter may be located however it is not required that a meter be present." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#UsagePoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "UsagePoint"@en .
