<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#UsagePointGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Abstraction for management of group communications within a twoway AMR system or the data for a group of related usage points. Commands can be issued to all of the usage points that belong to a usage point group using a defined group address and the underlying AMR communication infrastructure. " .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#UsagePointGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "UsagePointGroup"@en .
