<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#UsagePointLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Location of an individual usage point." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#UsagePointLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "UsagePointLocation"@en .
