<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Voltage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Voltage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CIMDatatype> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Voltage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Electrical voltage can be both AC and DC." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#Voltage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Voltage"@en .
