<https://w3id.org/saref#Commodity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A marketable item for which there is demand, but which is supplied without qualitative differentiation across a market. SAREF refers to energy commodities such as electricity, gas, coal and oil. " .
<https://w3id.org/saref#Commodity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Commodity" .
