<https://w3id.org/saref#EnergyMeter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An energy meter is a device of category saref:Meter that consists of a meter, accomplishes the tasks saref:MeterReading and saref:EnergyEfficiency, performs the saref:MeteringFunction and is used for the purpose of measuring the saref:Energy property" .
<https://w3id.org/saref#EnergyMeter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Energy meter" .
# 
