<https://w3id.org/saref#EnergyRelated> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A category that considers devices based on energy consumption information and profiles to optimize energy efficiency." .
<https://w3id.org/saref#EnergyRelated> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grid related" .
# 
