<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ASTMStandardKind.D924> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Standard Test Method for Dissipation Factor or Power Factor and Relative Permittivity Dielectric Constant of Electrical Insulating Liquids." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ASTMStandardKind.D924> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "D924"@en .
