<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ASTMStandardKind.D97> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ASTMStandardKind.D97> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ASTMStandardKind> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ASTMStandardKind.D97> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Standard Test Method for Pour Point of Petroleum Products  orStandard Test Method for Pour Point of Petroleum Oils." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ASTMStandardKind.D97> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "D97"@en .
