<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DERUnitSymbol.VArh> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Reactive energy in Volt Ampere reactive hours." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DERUnitSymbol.VArh> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "VArh"@en .
# 
