<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#GateLogicKind.xnor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A logical XNOR operation. The function is the inverse of the exclusive OR XOR gate. All input false or true will give true. Otherwise false." .
