<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MacroPeriodKind.specifiedPeriod> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MacroPeriodKind> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MacroPeriodKind.specifiedPeriod> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "For the period defined by the start and end of the TimePeriod element in the message." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MacroPeriodKind.specifiedPeriod> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "specifiedPeriod"@en .
