<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MarketRoleKind.competitiveRetailer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Competitive retailer." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MarketRoleKind.competitiveRetailer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "competitiveRetailer"@en .
