<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MarketRoleKind.complianceMonitor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MarketRoleKind.complianceMonitor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#MarketRoleKind> .
