<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#OrientationKind.negative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "For 2D diagrams a negative orientation gives the lefthand orientation favoured by computer graphics displays with X values increasing from left to right and Y values increasing from top to bottom.   This is also known as a left hand orientation." .
