<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PhaseShuntConnectionKind.G> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ground connection use when explicit connection to ground needs to be expressed in combination with the phase code such as for electrical wirecable or for meters." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PhaseShuntConnectionKind.G> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "G"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PhaseShuntConnectionKind.I
