<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PhaseShuntConnectionKind.I> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Independent winding for singlephase connections." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PhaseShuntConnectionKind.I> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "I"@en .
# 
# http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PhaseShuntConnectionKind.Y
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PhaseShuntConnectionKind.Y> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PhaseShuntConnectionKind.Y> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PhaseShuntConnectionKind> .
