<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PhaseShuntConnectionKind.Yn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PhaseShuntConnectionKind> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PhaseShuntConnectionKind.Yn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Wye with neutral brought out for grounding." .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PhaseShuntConnectionKind.Yn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Yn"@en .
