<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#VsPpccControlKind.pPccAndUdcDroop> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#VsPpccControlKind> .
<http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#VsPpccControlKind.pPccAndUdcDroop> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Control is active power at point of common coupling and local DC voltage with the droop. Target values are provided by ACDCConverter.targetPpcc ACDCConverter.targetUdc and VsConverter.droop." .
